WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:01.200
What's up guys!

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.180
Welcome to another episode of Challenge Pongfinity

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.760
Today we will try out this cricket bat.

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.640
Leave your ideas and comments in the comment-section below!

00:00:20.480 --> 00:00:22.540
I thought that you would be serving!

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:24.320
No, you are going to serve!

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:47.800
Let's try playing with a cricket bat!

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:13.800
How did you miss it?

00:01:16.560 --> 00:01:17.860
That was alright...

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:28.420
That's a scary shot!

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:39.520
First base!

00:02:37.840 --> 00:02:40.620
Okay, we are going to play a game of table tennis cricket.

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:45.360
You have to start running!

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:50.140
Do I get a point from hitting your shoes? No.

00:02:56.460 --> 00:02:59.400
I did it! One point!

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.000
I think I broke the ball.

00:03:29.100 --> 00:03:32.520
I think I was the winner of table tennis cricket!

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:34.500
I don't think so.

00:03:34.540 --> 00:03:35.720
I was clearly the winner.

00:03:35.720 --> 00:03:38.580
You can believe it yourself if you want to.

